"code": "class Solution:\n    def totalNQueens(self, n: int) -> int:\n        cols, diag, anti = set(), set(), set()\n        def place(r):\n            if r == n:\n                return 1                  # every row has a queen\n            count = 0\n            for c in range(n):\n                if c in cols or r - c in diag or r + c in anti:\n                    continue              # attacked: skip\n                cols.add(c)\n                diag.add(r - c)\n                anti.add(r + c)\n                count += place(r + 1)\n                cols.remove(c)\n                diag.remove(r - c)\n                anti.remove(r + c)\n            return count\n        return place(0)",
